# Exception: this file only contains public EXPO_PUBLIC_* values (Expo
# inlines these into the client bundle at build time regardless of secrecy
# anyway), and Vercel's build needs it present since it reads .env files
# directly from the checked-out repo. Keep everything else .env-ignored.
!app/frontend/.env

